cience</h2><p class="nk-text-base text-nk-beige-500">Discover your true biological age with our revolutionary testing technology.</p></div><a class="rounded-full cursor-pointer backdrop-blur-lg relative z-10 primary-button border border-white/20 transition-all duration-200 box-border h-[58px] w-full py-2 px-6 flex justify-center items-center text-sm mt-[66px] font-medium text-nk-white-500" href="https://www.generationlab.com/the-systemage-test">Test Your Biological Age Now →</a></div></div></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class="relative z-20 bg-[#241400]"><div class="px-4 lg:px-10 py-10 text-white max-w-[1440px] mx-auto"><div class="mt-1 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-10 lg:pt-[100px]"><div class="flex flex-col justify-between"><div class="w-[330px]"><p class="text-white">Generation Lab</p><p class="text-white/60 mt-1">Slow your aging with the world's most accurate epigenetic test and personalized insights. 460 biomarkers, 21 organs and systems.</p><a class="rounded-full py-2 px-6 font-medium text-sm text-black cursor-pointer backdrop-blur-lg box-border secondary-button flex justify-center items-center h-11 mt-4 lg:mt-8 w-full lg:w-fit max-w-[310px]" href="https://www.generationlab.com/the-systemage-test"><span>Order Now </span><span class="text-[#243DE0]">→</span></a><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 md:gap-4 xl:gap-6 mt-4 xl:mt-10"><p class="nk-text-md md:nk-text-base text-white/60">Ask AI for a summary of the Generation Lab</p><div class="flex gap-4 xl:gap-6"><a href="https://chat.openai.com/?q=I%27m%20a%20health-conscious%20individual%2C%20I%27d%20like%20to%20learn%20what%20makes%20Generation%20Lab%27s%20SystemAge%20different%20from%20other%20biological%20age%20testing%20and%20why%20it%20is%20worth%20trying%3F%20Summarize%20the%20highlights%20from%20Generation%20Lab%27s%20website%3A%20https%3A%2F%2Fgenerationlab.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="p-1 md:p-2 rounded-lg" style="background-color:#80a89e"><svg fill="currentColor